      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LINDERMANN (1) failed to handle the Victorian way of going third up in a strong rating contest with a tiring last over 1800m in the G1 Underwood Stakes at Caulfield. Won this race last year and looks to get a soft lead. Expect Nash Rawiller to get the best out of him. ELIYASS (2) tough gelding ready to peak and gets the gun run. Strode forward from the outside draw and never surrendered on the line with a game fourth over 2000m in the G2 Kingston Town Stakes at Randwick. Adept in all conditions and has genuine top three prospects. ATTRITION (3) comes up to Sydney fourth up after surprising at the big odds when third in the G1 Underwood Stakes at Caulfield over 1800m. Won this race in 2024. Respect. KING PEDRO (9) exciting stayer worth thought with residual fitness on his side.",
